(text "EIS path: AD5933 -> Howland VCCS; tetrapolar diff sense -> AD5933 VIN" (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5c16fdae-cadd-5b95-a6b5-c9ae605e773d))
(text "EIS path (red). AD5933 range 4 (198 mVpp @ 3.3 V) -> C405 -> improved Howland: Iout = Vin/R4b = 99 mV/49.9k = 1.98 uA pk, R2/R1 = (R4a+R4b)/R3 = 1." (at 20 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c96690fa-7bd9-50b6-92d1-2c3a8df94de1))
(text "R3 = R412 + R413 + AD5933 Rout(~600R, range 4) = 99.8k keeps the bridge balanced (Zout > 10 MOhm). Compliance: Vo = 2(Vin + 2 VL)/3 -> VL <= 2 V pk keeps U402 inputs below the OPA192 input-stage transition (V+ - 3 V)." (at 20 30.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 785c70fb-3914-5fbf-a970-a3f1d788df4d))
(text "Sense: EIS_SENSE_P/N -> U401A/B followers -> U401C difference amp G = 40.2k/10k = 4.02, referenced to VHALF_1V65 = AD5933 VDD/2," (at 20 33.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 577816d0-922e-5218-a000-c4fdaf89dac2))
(text "  -> R409 (V->I) into AD5933 VIN virtual earth; RFB = R410 = 20k. AD5933 sees Zx = R409 * (Vexc / (4.02 * Vtissue)); calibrate with dummy networks." (at 20 35.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid df83ccc8-10af-5d01-971f-c2f7ad351527))
